      "illus": null,
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 240 120' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><g><path d='M18 80V47L55 22L92 47V80Z' fill='#EDE4D3' stroke='#2F4D7A' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M39 80V55H68V80M22 47H88' fill='none' stroke='#8A8178' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M30 75L75 50' stroke='#C8553D' stroke-width='3'/></g><path d='M120 82.00H227M122 20V85' fill='none' stroke='#8A8178' stroke-width='1.2'/><path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M122.00 62.67L124.04 61.15L126.08 59.70L128.12 58.31L130.16 56.97L132.20 55.71L134.24 54.50L136.28 53.36L138.32 52.27L140.36 51.25L142.40 50.29L144.44 49.40L146.48 48.56L148.52 47.79L150.56 47.08L152.60 46.43L154.64 45.84L156.68 45.31L158.72 44.85L160.76 44.45L162.80 44.11L164.84 43.83L166.88 43.61L168.92 43.46L170.96 43.36L173.00 43.33L175.04 43.36L177.08 43.46L179.12 43.61L181.16 43.83L183.20 44.11L185.24 44.45L187.28 44.85L189.32 45.31L191.36 45.84L193.40 46.43L195.44 47.08L197.48 47.79L199.52 48.56L201.56 49.40L203.60 50.29L205.64 51.25L207.68 52.27L209.72 53.36L211.76 54.50L213.80 55.71L215.84 56.97L217.88 58.31L219.92 59.70L221.96 61.15L224.00 62.67' fill='none' stroke='#2F4D7A' stroke-width='2.6'/><circle class='pop' style='--d:.2s' cx='173.00' cy='43.33' r='4' fill='#C8553D' stroke='#C8553D' stroke-width='2'/><g font-family='sans-serif' font-size='11.5' fill='#2A2522' text-anchor='middle'><text x='120' y='101'>지붕 단면: 가로 0~2m</text><text x='120' y='116'>가운데 높이 2m가 최대</text></g></svg>",
      "title": "작은 지붕 모형은 가장 높은 곳이 있을까?",
      "body": "지붕 단면을 0≤x≤2에서 h(x)=2−(x−1)²m로 정한다고 가정해요. 이 연속함수는 닫힌구간에서 최댓값과 최솟값을 가져요. 제곱이 0~1이므로 가운데 x=1m에서 높이 2m가 최대이고, 양 끝 높이 1m가 최소예요.",
